  "title": "Asian-Style Pork Chop Bake",
  "description": "Fresh ginger and garlic add a snappy bite to pork chops baked in teriyaki sauce, orange juice and sherry. Be sure to marinate your chops in the morning so they&#39;ll be oven-ready by evening.",
